      "text": "New Year in Rio de Janeiro is one of the Must do experiences!\n\nLife music, dinner, and champagne flow freely, and then it's time for amazing fireworks, right at Copacabana Beach! Go on to party all night or go for a refreshing swim in the ocean!\n\nAfter all, its 35 degrees, high summer! Plunge into the atmosphere of this marvelous  city with its unique nature and the feeling of an eternal holiday.\n\nYou will remember this New Year forever!",
